+	// Modified by High Five Labs: with ASO_GENERATOR_MORE_EXTENSION_SCOPES set,
+	// two more names of an arbitrary scope are extension prefixes,
+	// /{resourceId}/ (as open ASO pull request #5783 adds, for Defender for
